  m_Name: LightWarmup
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::YourCall.Dilemma
  _id: warmup_flight
  _verb: 0
  _weight: 0
  _narratorPrompt: Let us warm up. Nothing on the line, nobody dies, you have my word, for whatever that is worth down here. One gift, yours to keep forever. Would you rather be able to fly wherever you please, or to be strong enough to lift anything that ever stood in your way. Do not overthink it. I will know if you lie.
  _choices:
  - _id: fly
    _label: Fly
    _narratorReact: Up and off the ground. Of course you would. You want them craning their necks to watch you go. A man who sat up high in life still reaches for the height. Noted.
    _narratorReactStruck:
    _struckParty:
    _gambledParty:
    _route: straight
    _diverts: 0
    _seedVotes: 57
    _endsGame: 0
    _profileImpact: []
  - _id: strength
    _label: Super strength
    _narratorReact: Strength. You would rather force the world than float above it. A man who spent his days with the power to make people do as they were told, now reaching for the kind you can feel in your hands. We will find out what you would most like to break.
    _narratorReactStruck:
    _struckParty:
    _gambledParty:
    _route: straight
    _diverts: 0
    _seedVotes: 43
    _endsGame: 0
    _profileImpact: []
